# Agent tooling scratch (subagent run artifacts)
.pi-subagents/

# Copied in at pack/publish time by each package's `prepack`, because npm reads
# a README and a LICENSE only from the package DIRECTORY, never from the repo
# root. Generated, so not source: committed, they would be 19 copies free to
# drift from the single file they mirror.
/packages/cli/README.md
/packages/*/LICENSE
/platforms/*/LICENSE
